  "description": {
   "en": "VRMMORPG \"World Of Load\". \n\nYuya Nakano is a high school student who plays this world-famous game at his leisure. He is neither ugly nor handsome. He is neither stupid nor a genius. He is neither athletic nor athletic-minded. He has a medium build and medium height,  but there is one thing that sets him apart from the ordinary high school boy. He was the guildmaster of the strongest guild in the \"World Of Load\"."
